stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending: save exact tool version and arguments
    pending --> confirmed: same bound owner confirms
    pending --> rejected: owner rejects
    pending --> expired: TTL passes
    pending --> cancelled: tool changed or disabled
    confirmed --> claimed: atomic claim and recheck
    confirmed --> expired: TTL passes
    confirmed --> cancelled: tool changed or disabled
    claimed --> completed: result persisted
    claimed --> unknown: crash or lost result
    completed --> [*]
    rejected --> [*]
    expired --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]
    unknown --> [*]
